message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Fatture: invoicing program for the lira-euro changeover (Visual Basic 6, 2000–2003)"
version: "2000 Euro"
abstract: "Fatture (“SE Fatture 2000 Euro”) is a small invoicing program for a professional practice. It manages customers and products, issues invoices with discounts, payment terms, delivery-note and order references and VAT, shows amounts in both lire and euro during the changeover period, and produces statistics by customer, product and month."
